Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:50.41,Note,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,[法语] 宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:54.60,Note,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,[法语] 外面是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.52,0:17:04.60,Note,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(梅里恩街)
