Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.65,1:35:30.60,Note,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(进去吧)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.30,1:38:55.43,Note,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(资料移至拉雪兹神父公墓内的 莱斯特兰奇家族陵墓)
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.17,1:47:06.92,Note,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(考乌斯·莱斯特兰奇)
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.69,2:08:25.99,Note,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(奥地利 纽蒙迦德城堡)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.09,0:01:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你很开心能够摆脱他吧  我想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be glad to be rid of him, I expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们更希望他能够继续在牢里关着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd be more than happy to keep him here in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,六个月已经足够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six months are enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.77,0:01:45.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是时候为他在欧洲犯下的罪行担上责任了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time for him to answer for his crimes in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.10,0:01:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,皮克科瑞主席 斯皮尔曼先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}President Picquery, Mr. Spielman, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.98,0:01:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,犯人已经准备好转移了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner is secured and ready to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们把能用的招都用上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've thrown everything at him, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这很有必要 他太强大了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was necessary. He's extremely powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们换了三次守卫 他嘴皮子非常厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had to change his guard three times, he's very... persuasive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我们割掉了他的舌头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we removed his tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格林德沃 格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald! Grindelwald!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格林德沃 格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald! Grindelwald!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.11,0:02:40.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,全球的巫师界都欠你一个人情 主席女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wizarding community worldwide owes you a great debt, Madam President.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要小看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.33,0:02:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯皮尔曼先生 我们刚发现他藏起来的魔杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Spielman, we found his wand hidden away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿伯内西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abernathy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:58.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还找到这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we found this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.73,0:03:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还油嘴滑舌吗 嗯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more silver tongue, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的朋友 你加入了一项高尚的事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have joined a noble cause, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.13,0:06:22.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安东尼奥 我知道 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I know. I know, Antonio
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:30.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太饥渴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So needy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:41.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们准备好了 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're ready for you, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.02,0:08:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leta...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在这里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.15,0:08:52.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忒修斯认为我成为魔法部大家族的一员是个很好的主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus thought it would be good if I became part of the Ministry family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他真的用了"大家族"这个词吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he actually say the words "Ministry family"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.41,0:08:58.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不愧是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sounds like my brother
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没来吃晚餐 忒修斯很失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus was disappointed you couldn't come to dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每次问你你都没空\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any of the nights we've asked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.77,0:09:23.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've been busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.23,0:09:24.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是你的哥哥 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's your brother, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.68,0:09:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他喜欢跟你在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He likes spending time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.56,0:09:29.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 皮克 跳进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oi, you! Hop in, Pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.37,0:09:40.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么那些奇奇怪怪的生物那么喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do strange creatures love you so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-唔  没有什么奇奇怪怪的生物... -只有心胸狭隘的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Well, there are no strange creatures... - Only blinkered people!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.88,0:09:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说完这个之后被普伦德加斯特留堂了多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long did you get in detention for saying that to Prendergast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好像是一个月吧 那一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I think it was a month that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:57.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,记得吗 我为了跟你一起还在他桌子底下设了个粪蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I set off a Dung bomb under his desk so I could join you, do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是很记得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I actually don't remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们好啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.23,0:10:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忒修斯 我们刚才在说纽特会来一起享用晚餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus. We were just talking about Newt coming for dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:13.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喔 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:15.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 在我们进去之前 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, before we go in there I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.15,0:10:18.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忒修斯 这都第五次了 我知道程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my fifth attempt, Theseus. I know the form.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:20.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次跟其他的不一样 这次...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't going to be like the other times. This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.83,0:10:23.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,心态尽量放开点 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just try and keep an open mind, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:27.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-然后尽量不要那么... -像我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-And maybe a little less. - Like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:30.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又不会少一块肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it can't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.46,0:10:32.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.84,0:10:40.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听证会开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hearing commences...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你希望我们终止对你国际旅行的禁令 为什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want an end to the ban on your traveling internationally. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.18,0:10:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我喜欢国际旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I like to travel internationally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:54.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,申请人拒绝合作并刻意回避回答上次国际旅行的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject uncooperative and evasive on reasons for last international trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.57,0:10:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那次只是一次实地考察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.61,0:10:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在为我关于神奇动物的书收集资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I was collecting material for my book on magical beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你毁了半个纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You destroyed half of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.24,0:11:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-不对 实际上有两个方面不正确 -纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-No, that's actually factually incorrect on two counts. -Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.41,0:11:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯卡曼德先生 显然你很困扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scamander, it's clear you're frustrated and
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:12.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坦白说, 我们也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}frankly, so are we
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,折中一点 我们想达成一个协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the spirit of compromise, we'd like to make a proposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.30,0:11:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么样的协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of proposition?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.09,0:11:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,答应一个条件 委员会就终止你的旅行禁令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The committee will agree to lift your travel ban under one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你加入魔法部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You join the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,准确来说 加入你哥哥的部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Specifically, your brother's department.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.90,0:11:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得忒修斯比较适合做傲罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...I think that... Theseus is the Auror
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.09,0:11:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我认为我另有所长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think my talents lie elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:44.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯卡曼德先生 巫师和非巫师世界的和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scamander, The wizarding and non-wizarding
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.27,0:11:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,已经持续了一个多世纪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}worlds have been at peace for over a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格林德沃想摧毁这份和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald wants to see that peace destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对于我们社会的某些人来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for certain members of our community
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.96,0:11:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他的思想是十分吸引人的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his message is very seductive
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.88,0:12:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很多纯血认为他们生为统治者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many pure-bloods believe it is their birthright to rule
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.05,0:12:05.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不只是在巫师界 在麻瓜世界亦是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not only our world but the non-magic world as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.06,0:12:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们认格林德沃为领导者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They see Grindelwald as their hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.68,0:12:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而格林德沃将这个男孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Grindelwald sees this boy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.10,0:12:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看作能使这一切成为现实的手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a means to make this all come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 你说的好像克雷登斯还在世一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. You're talking about Credence as if he were still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.86,0:12:22.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特 他活了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He survived, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,几个月前他离开了纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left New York months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.79,0:12:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在欧洲的某个地方 我们不知道确切地点 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's somewhere in Europe. Where exactly, we don't know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们希望我去抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you want me to hunt Credence down?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.42,0:12:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去杀了他?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还是老样子啊 斯卡曼德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same old Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.59,0:12:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在这里干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接手软弱的你不敢做的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Taking on the job you're too soft to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.97,0:12:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就这样吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.81,0:12:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,拒绝通过旅行档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Travel documentation denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你以为我会喜欢格里姆森的主意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I like the idea of Grimmson any more than you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.74,0:13:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听着 忒修斯 我不想听什么结果胜于手段如何如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I don't want to hear how the ends justify the means, Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.70,0:13:09.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不能再像鸵鸟把自己的头埋在沙子里似的逃避现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you're gonna have to pull your head out of the sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:11.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,啊, 对, 又来了. 多么自私...不负责任...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, right, here we go. What a selfish... irresponsible...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.87,0:13:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个时代快来临了 每一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, the time is coming when everyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每一个人 都要选边站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everyone's gonna have to pick a side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:18.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,连你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.38,0:13:21.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不站边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't do sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt. Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:34.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C'mere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们时时刻刻都在盯着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.75,0:13:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:00.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想 这代表这份任务 归我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume this means I have the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,彻底清理之后 这里就会变得很舒适了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will be suitable after a thorough cleanse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.84,0:15:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我希望你现在就动身去马戏团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go to the circus now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把我的信带给克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give my note to Credence,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开始他的旅程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}begin his journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等我们赢了 有成千上万的人会逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we've won, they'll flee cities in the millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们得意得够久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've had their time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.64,0:15:40.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些事情不需要我们大声说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't say such things out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只想要自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want only freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以做自己的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freedom to be ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.69,0:15:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还要消灭不会魔法的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To annihilate non-wizards.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:49.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是他们所有人 不全是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all of them. Not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还不至于那么无情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not merciless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.57,0:15:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,任何时候都需要用来干活的牲畜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The beast of burden will always be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,风旋骤卷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ventus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:50.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你非得站在这么显眼的屋顶上吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were the less conspicuous rooftops full, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:17:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我确实很喜欢欣赏风景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do enjoy a view.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.24,0:18:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,云雾缥缈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nebulus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.92,0:18:07.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.13,0:18:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们仍然坚信是你派我去纽约的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're still convinced that you sent me to New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:12.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说不是我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told them I didn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.84,0:18:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:16.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,虽然确实是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even though you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.30,0:18:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是你告诉我哪里可以找到那只被交易的雷鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You told me where to find that trafficked Thunderbird,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.39,0:18:23.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邓布利多 你清楚我会带他回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore. You knew that I would take him home
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.35,0:18:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也知道我只能用麻瓜的交通工具带他走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you knew I'd have to take him through a Muggle port.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯 我总觉得我和那些有强大魔力的鸟类有亲切感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've always felt an affinity with the great magical birds..
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.73,0:18:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我家族中有一个传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a story in my family
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邓布利多家族的人有急切需要时 凤凰就会出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a phoenix will come to any Dumbledore who is in desperate need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.48,0:18:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,据说我的曾祖父就有一只 但是自从他去世后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say my great-great grandfather had one, but that it took flight when he died,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.07,0:18:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,凤凰就再也没有出现过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.66,0:18:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恕我冒昧 教授 我绝对不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect, I don't believe for a minute
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.91,0:18:45.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是你告诉我雷鸟的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's why you told me about the Thunderbird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.60,0:19:04.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你为什么要送我去纽约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you send me to New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我知道格林德沃会试图抓住克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I knew Grindelwald would try to catch Credence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要知道 多年以前 他就预知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a vision, you see, many years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个默然者杀死了他最害怕的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In which an Obscurial killed a man he fears above all others
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.28,0:19:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:24.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得你能消灭格林德沃的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you might deprive Grindelwald of his weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不过不是要杀死克雷登斯 而是拯救他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not by killing Credence, but by saving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯在巴黎 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence is in Paris, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:37.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在寻找到自己真正的家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's trying to trace his real family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.25,0:19:39.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这我信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我估计你已听说 关于他真实身分的传闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've heard the rumors about who he really is?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:43.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.31,0:19:55.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纯血家族认为他是法国一个重要家族最后的血脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pure-bloods think he's the last of an important French line,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.94,0:20:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们认为 他在婴儿时期就失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a baby whom everyone thought lost
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-那不是指莉塔的弟弟吧? -大家是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not Leta's brother? - That's what they're whispering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无论是不是纯血 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pure-blood or not, I know this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.49,0:20:10.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,默默然是因为缺少关爱而产生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Obscurus grows in the absence of love
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.25,0:20:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能终日与黑暗为伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a dark twin, an only friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:16.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果克雷登斯真的有亲生的兄弟姐妹能够代替默默然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Credence has a real brother or sister out there that can take its place,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他也许还有救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he might yet be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.09,0:20:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不论他在巴黎的何处 若不是身处险境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wherever Credence is in Paris, he's either in danger
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是会危害他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or a danger to others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.14,0:20:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们仍然不知道他到底是谁 但是我们必须找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We may not know who he is yet, but he needs to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我希望你能找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I rather hoped you might be the one to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.69,0:20:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是我一个老熟人的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An address of a very old acquaintance of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是巴黎的一处安全屋 用魔法进行保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A safe house in Paris, reinforced with enchantments.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.87,0:20:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,安全屋 我为什么需要在巴黎用安全屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safe house? Why would I need a safe house in Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也希望你用不上 但是凡事总会有意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hopes you won't, but should things at some point go terribly wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:55.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有地方去总是件好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's good to have a place to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.83,0:20:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,至少能喝杯茶 你懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, for a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.21,0:21:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 不 不 绝对不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我被禁止出境旅行 邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm banned from international travel, Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:06.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我离开英国 他们就会把我丢进阿兹卡班 然后把钥匙丢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I leave the country, they will put me in Azkaban and throw away the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.97,0:21:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-你知道为什么我如此喜欢你吗 纽特? -为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Do you know why I admire you, Newt? -Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.27,0:21:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,认识的人里我最喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More, perhaps, than any man I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不渴望权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't seek power
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:18.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或者名气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.44,0:21:24.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在乎的 是事物的本身是否正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You simply ask, is the thing right in itself?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果是 你会为此不计一切代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it is, you do it, no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:30.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧差不多是这样 邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's all very well, Dumbledore
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.29,0:21:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是请原谅 我想问 为什么你不去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, forgive me for asking, why can't you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不能对抗格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot move against Grindelwald.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只能是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.02,0:21:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 我不怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I can't blame you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我是你 我也很可能会拒绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in your shoes I'd probably refuse too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.52,0:21:58.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-什么... -不早了 晚安 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - It's late. Good evening, Newt
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:21:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.19,0:22:02.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 不会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.12,0:22:18.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.69,0:23:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunty!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.57,0:23:34.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邦缇 嗅嗅宝宝又跑出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bunty, the baby Nifflers are loose again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.13,0:23:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我很抱歉 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.88,0:23:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们肯定是趁我清理卜鸟的时候溜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have picked the lock while I was cleaning out the Augureys
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.18,0:23:52.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.73,0:24:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差不多都喂了 给平奇滴了鼻液 然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've fed nearly everyone, Pinky's had his nose drops, and
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾尔西呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Elsie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.98,0:24:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,艾尔西的粪便也快要正常了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elsie's droppings are nearly normal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.69,0:24:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.61,0:24:09.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在可以下班了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can clock off now...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-我跟你说过把马形水怪交给我 -伤口还需要擦药膏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you to leave the Kelpie to me. - That wound needs more ointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.33,0:24:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想你失去你的手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want you losing fingers over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.75,0:24:29.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说真的 快回去吧 邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, you go home now, Bunty.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.84,0:24:32.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你肯定累坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.47,0:24:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,两个人一起对付马形水怪会更容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the Kelpie's easier with two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.22,0:24:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要不要把衬衫脱了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps you should take off your shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.23,0:24:44.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.06,0:24:46.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我马上就能弄干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll dry off quickly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.31,0:25:31.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看起来有人需要宣泄一下感情 药膏 邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone needed to let off some steam. Ointment, Bunty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.66,0:25:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你再敢咬邦缇 我就要给你点颜色看看了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bite Bunty again and there'll be trouble, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.41,0:25:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么声音?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.17,0:25:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.79,0:25:51.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是我想你真的该回家了 邦缇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I want you to go home now, Bunty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.67,0:25:53.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,需要我叫魔法部吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall I call the Ministry?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.13,0:25:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我需要你回家 请回吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I want you to go home. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.85,0:26:05.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果可以 请把东西给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could just give it to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.98,0:26:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亲爱的 麻烦把它给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, if you could just give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.69,0:26:09.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-他不会介意的 拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He doesn't care. Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.23,0:26:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就把它给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could just give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.03,0:26:18.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.28,0:26:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特！到这里来 你这个小疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}NEWT! Get over here, you maniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.41,0:26:25.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们希望你不会介意 纽特 我们擅自进来了...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hope you don't mind, Newt? We let ourselves in...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,外面在下雨 倾盆大雨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's raining out there-cats and dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伦敦真冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}London's cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.25,0:26:32.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是你不是应该一忘皆空了吗！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you were supposed to have been Obliviated!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.17,0:26:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道 但这没用 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know! It didn't work, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.55,0:26:38.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是说 你说过 那个毒液只会消除不好的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, you said it, the potion only erases bad memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.55,0:26:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我压根儿没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.05,0:26:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别误会 我是有一些奇怪的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, don't get me wrong, I had some weird ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.43,0:26:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是这个天使...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but this angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.93,0:26:50.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这位天使把我遗忘的部分又重新告诉我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this angel over here, she filled me in on all the bad parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.61,0:26:52.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我们现在在这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here we are, I guess, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.44,0:26:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.03,0:26:58.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 那是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait... is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.37,0:27:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜 蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina? Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.50,0:27:07.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 亲爱的 这里只有我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh it's just us, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.58,0:27:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我和雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.63,0:27:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不介意我给大家做晚餐吧 嗯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't I make us some dinner, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.59,0:27:14.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好棒！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.59,0:27:20.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗨,甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hon
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.76,0:27:22.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜和我都不怎么说话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina and I aren't talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.43,0:27:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.60,0:27:28.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗯...你知道 她发现了我和雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh well, you know, she found out about Jacob and
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.39,0:27:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一直在见面 她不喜欢我们这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I seeing each other and she didn't like it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.19,0:27:32.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为"法律"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cause of the "law."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.06,0:27:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不许...不许和麻鸡约会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not allowed oops, not allowed to date No-Majs,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.19,0:27:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不许和他们结婚 没完没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not allowed to marry them blah, blah, blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.70,0:27:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并且 因为你 她总是很容易感到烦躁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, she was all in a tizzy anyway, 'cause of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.74,0:27:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.74,0:27:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 就你 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you, Newt
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.29,0:27:47.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,《意乱情迷》上都写了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was in Spellbound
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.41,0:27:49.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在这 我替你带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, I brought it for you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.63,0:27:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特·斯卡曼德和未婚妻莉塔·莱斯特兰奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt Scamander and fiancee Leta Lestrange
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.51,0:28:00.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哥哥忒修斯的伴侣未知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother Thesus and unknown woman
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.55,0:28:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 要娶莉塔的是忒修斯不是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. So Thesus is marrying Leta, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.76,0:28:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Oh dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.60,0:28:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.56,0:28:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜看到消息后 就开始跟别人约会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Tina read that, and she started dating someone else
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.48,0:28:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是个傲罗 叫阿喀琉斯·托利弗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an auror. His name is Achilles Tolliver
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.82,0:28:21.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,托利佛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tolliver
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.49,0:28:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总之 我们来这里真的很高兴 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ANYWAY, we are really excited to be here Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.04,0:28:34.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这次旅行对我们来说很特别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a special trip for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.67,0:28:37.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Jacob and I
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.21,0:28:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就要结婚啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting married!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.84,0:28:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,和雅各布结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marry Jacob
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.98,0:28:54.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你对他施法了是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've enchanted him, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.31,0:28:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.61,0:28:59.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.48,0:29:01.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你能不能别读我心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you stop reading my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.28,0:29:03.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮 你违背他的意愿带他来这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie, you've brought him here against his will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.07,0:29:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢 你怎么能这么说 看看他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that is an outrageous accusation. Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.20,0:29:09.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他现在特别开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.29,0:29:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你不会介意我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you won't mind if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.17,0:29:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,千万别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.46,0:29:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮 如果他想结婚的话你没什么好怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie, you've got nothing to fear if he wants to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.75,0:29:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们可以让他恢复正常 然后自己告诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can just lift the enchantment... and he can tell us himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.93,0:29:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.73,0:29:35.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要干什么 你要用它干什么 斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatchu gonna do? Whatchu gonna do with that, Mr. Scamander?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.23,0:29:37.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,咒术解除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surgito.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.62,0:29:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布 恭喜你的订婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations on your engagement, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:29:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.96,0:29:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦不 你没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.67,0:30:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎儿 等下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queen. A second.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.09,0:30:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.22,0:30:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.93,0:30:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在到底在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell am I right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.26,0:30:10.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,额 伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, uh, London.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.89,0:30:13.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢 我一直想来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! I always wanted to go here!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.35,0:30:15.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.15,0:30:20.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢 奎妮 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Queenie, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.90,0:30:25.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 我只是想问一下 你准备什么时候让我恢复正常 当我们有了五个孩子以后吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm just curious, when were you going to wake me up? After we'd had five kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.86,0:30:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-我想嫁给你有错吗 -好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why is it wrong to want to marry you? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想要个家庭有错吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To wanna have a family?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.41,0:30:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只想拥有其他人有的东西 就这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want what everyone else has, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.21,0:30:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 等等 我们都讨论过这个 快几百万次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, wait.. We talked about this, like, a million times.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.13,0:30:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果他们发现我们两个结婚的话 他们会把你扔进监狱的 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we get married and they find out, they're gonna throw you in jail, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.30,0:30:46.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不能让这发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.80,0:30:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们不喜欢像我这样的人和像你这样的人通婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't like people like me marrying people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.60,0:30:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是个巫师 只是个普通人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't a wizard. I'm just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.97,0:30:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们这边很包容 我们可以光明正大结婚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're really progressive here, and they'll let us get married properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.06,0:31:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亲爱的 你不需要对我施法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetheart, you don't need to enchant me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.15,0:31:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我早已为你着迷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm already enchanted!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.86,0:31:05.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我太爱你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.78,0:31:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-真的吗 -真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah?? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.57,0:31:11.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我不能让你这样冒险 你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can't have you risking everything like this, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.28,0:31:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不给我任何选择 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not giving us a choice, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.00,0:31:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也没有给我一个选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not givin' me a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.41,0:31:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们两个必须有一个人需要勇敢起来 然后你还是个懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of us had to be brave, and you were being a coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.67,0:31:25.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是个懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was being a coward?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.05,0:31:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我是个懦夫 你就是个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I'm a coward, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.93,0:31:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.39,0:31:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say it...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.85,0:31:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-你不需要说出口 -我不是那个意思 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You didn't have to. - No, I didn't mean it, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.89,0:31:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 你就是那个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.48,0:31:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要去见我姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go see my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.94,0:31:45.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-好 去见你姐姐去吧 - 好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Fine. See your sister. - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.65,0:31:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.36,0:31:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie! No! Queenie!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.32,0:31:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.20,0:31:57.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我什么也没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.51,0:32:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恢复如初\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Papyrus Reparo
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.06,0:32:17.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}PARIS
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.56,0:32:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我亲爱的奎妮 这可真是个美丽的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Queenie, what a beautiful city.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.69,0:32:28.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在想你 蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm thinking of you. Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.49,0:32:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Newt?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.12,0:32:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在下面 雅各布 我马上过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here, Jacob. I'll be with you in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.46,0:32:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我自己的麻烦就不少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got my own problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.05,0:32:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,邦缇 别忘了给帕特里克喂药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}BUNTY! DON'T FORGET TO GIVE PATRICK PELLETS.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.35,0:33:03.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,（蒂娜·戈德斯坦恩成为傲罗）\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina Goldstein pointed as auror
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.03,0:33:11.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮留下一张明信片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie left a postcard.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.86,0:33:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜在巴黎找克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina's in Paris looking for Credence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.91,0:33:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.11,0:33:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮会直接去找蒂娜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie's gonna go straight for Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.24,0:33:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好的 我们要去法国了 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we're going to France, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.08,0:33:21.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 等下 我去拿我的夹克 - 我拿好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold on. I'll get my jacket. - I've got it
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.84,0:33:30.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,棒极了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.47,0:33:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.68,0:33:41.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得叫邦缇应付这些生物和一堆新生儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it's reasonable to ask Bunty to cope with everyone here
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.14,0:33:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不太合理,所以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a bunch of newborns, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.89,0:33:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你疯了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.35,0:33:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你现在要打包嗅嗅了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna pack the nifflers now?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.15,0:33:50.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-进去吧 -记得上次发生什么事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- In you hop. - Remember what happened last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.15,0:33:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们把锁修好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fixed the lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.19,0:33:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在没我允许什么都跑不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So nothing gets out without my say-so
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.03,0:33:57.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.58,0:34:00.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快点啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.75,0:34:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,行吧 项链飞来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right then. Accio necklace
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.59,0:34:19.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在你做个好榜样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you set a good example
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.89,0:34:26.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,（邦缇 我带了嗅嗅去巴黎 --纽特）\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}BUNTY, GONE TO PARIS. HAVE TAKEN NIFFLERS WITH ME. NEWT.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.63,0:35:40.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纳吉尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nagini.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.64,0:35:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.10,0:35:53.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我知道她在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.24,0:36:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们今晚逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We escape tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.91,0:36:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.79,0:36:10.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我跟你说过离她远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've told you to stay away from her, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.87,0:36:12.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说过你可以休息了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I say you could take a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.88,0:36:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去给河童洗澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clean out the Kappa.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.21,0:36:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你 去做准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you, get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.39,0:36:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,接下来 我们这个精奇古怪的表演里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next in our little show of freaks and oddities...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.98,0:36:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要呈现给各位的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I present to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.48,0:36:40.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是一个血咒宿主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a Maledictus!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它曾经被困在印度尼西亚的森林里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once trapped in the jungles of Indonesia,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.58,0:36:50.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,身上背负着血咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she is the carrier of a blood curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.91,0:36:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像她这样的生物 一生的宿命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such Under-beings are destined, through the course of their lives...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.67,0:36:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,注定是会永远转变成野兽的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to turn permanently into beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.55,0:37:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看看她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.68,0:37:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多么漂亮 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So beautiful, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.89,0:37:10.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如此诱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So desirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.60,0:37:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是很快 她会永远被困在一副截然不同的躯体里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But soon she will be trapped forever in a very different body.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.52,0:37:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每晚当她沉睡时,女士们和先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every night, when she sleeps, mesdames et messieurs...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.78,0:37:25.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她都会变成...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is forced to become...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.08,0:37:35.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她都会变成...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is forced to become...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.38,0:37:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她都会变成...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is forced to become...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.35,0:37:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,久而久之 她就再也变不回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over time, she will not be able to transform back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.52,0:38:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她会永远被困在蛇的躯体之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She will be forever trapped in the body of a snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.02,0:38:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.74,0:38:49.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,收拾东西走人 巴黎容不下我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pack it up! Paris is done for us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.73,0:39:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,关于和血咒宿主一起的男孩 你都了解些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy with the Maledictus, what do you know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.03,0:39:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他在找他的妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's looking for his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.86,0:39:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我马戏团里所有的怪胎们觉得他们能回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All my freaks think they can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.45,0:39:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.64,0:39:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看 我觉得我们是因为同一个原因来到马戏团的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I think we were both at the circus for the same reason, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.76,0:39:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是卡玛 尤瑟夫·卡玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kama. Yusuf Kama.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.89,0:40:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you think right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.23,0:40:02.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-你想找克雷登斯干什么 -跟你一样的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want with Credence? - The same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.44,0:40:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说说看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.52,0:40:05.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,证明他的真实身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To prove who the boy really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.19,0:40:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果关于他身份的传言属实 那我们算是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the rumors of his identity are correct, he and I are
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.32,0:40:14.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,远亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}distantly related.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.62,0:40:18.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是我们纯血家族里的最后一名男丁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the last male of my pure-blooded line.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.79,0:40:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若传闻属实 他也是我的族人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, if the rumors are correct, is he
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.13,0:40:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你读过泰克 多多纳斯的预言录吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you read The Predictions of Tycho Dodonus?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.59,0:40:30.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,读过 但那只是诗 不能作为证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. But that's poetry, not proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.35,0:40:36.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我可以给你看看更充分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I could show you something better
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.89,0:40:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,更有说服力的证据 一些能证实他身份的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more concrete, something that proves who he is
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.02,0:40:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欧洲和美国的魔法部会让他活下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would the Ministries of Europe and America let him live?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.61,0:40:48.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They might.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.94,0:40:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那就跟我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then come.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.12,0:41:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,又来了 亚克斯利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no, Yaxley
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.71,0:41:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我讨厌他每次都这样直勾勾地盯着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate the way he makes a beeline for me every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.42,0:41:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没办法 谁让你一直都是屋子里最美的女人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if you insist on being the most beautiful woman in the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.55,0:41:10.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道他不是这样想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not that and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.92,0:41:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,亚克斯利的双手沾满了鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all blood with Yaxley.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.13,0:41:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那我去祝贺他一下 我们就可以跳舞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go and congratulate him and we can dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.01,0:41:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而我保证在这以后今晚都不会跟任何人说一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I promise I won't say a word to anyone for the rest of the night
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.47,0:41:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-你保证? -我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You promise? - Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.23,0:41:27.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.03,0:41:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-你最近怎么样 -你这只老狐狸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How have you been? - You sly dog
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.62,0:41:43.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是她吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.12,0:41:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.67,0:41:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她弟弟还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her brother's alive
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.76,0:41:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,预言是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The prediction is true
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.26,0:41:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她弟弟会带领我们走出阴霾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her brother would lead us from the shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.24,0:42:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"回来吧 伟大的复仇者 带着水中之翼"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Return, great avenger, with wings from the water"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.00,0:42:24.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉塔 恭喜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, Leta
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.08,0:42:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你弟弟活下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your brother lives
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.00,0:42:28.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们都十分相信这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all truly believe it
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.35,0:43:29.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.11,0:43:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯 拜尔本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence Barebone
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.11,0:43:40.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,差点被他的养母毁掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nearly destroyed by the woman who raised him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.16,0:43:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但现在他在寻找他的生母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet now he seeks the mother who bore him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.83,0:43:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他渴望家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's desperate for family.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.62,0:43:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他渴望被爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's desperate for love.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.83,0:43:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是我们成功的关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the key to our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.42,0:43:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们知道那个男孩在哪 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we know where the boy is, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.67,0:43:59.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么我们不抓了他就走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't we grab him and leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.84,0:44:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他必须自愿来找我 而他也会这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must come to me freely,and he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.47,0:44:08.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,路已经铺好了 他正在顺着它前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The path has been laid, and he is following it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.44,0:44:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这条路会把他带向我的身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The trail that will lead him to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.44,0:44:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也会向他揭示他古怪而又光荣的身世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the strange and glorious truth of who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.28,0:44:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么他如此重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is he so important?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.29,0:44:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁代表着我们事业最大的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who represents the greatest threat to our cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.67,0:44:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿不思·邓布利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.75,0:44:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果我让你现在去学校 把他从藏身之处揪出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I asked you now to go to the school... where he is
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.80,0:44:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,替我杀了他 你愿意吗 克拉尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hiding and kill him for me, would you do it for me, Krall?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.89,0:44:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯是这世上唯一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence is the only entity alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.02,0:44:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能杀死他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who can kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.48,0:44:57.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你真的认为他可以杀了伟大的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think that he can kill the great...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.99,0:45:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以杀了阿不思·邓布利多吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can kill Albus Dumbledore?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.78,0:45:04.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道他可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.49,0:45:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但克拉尔 当这一切发生时 你还会和我们站在一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But will you be with us when that happens, Krall?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.62,0:45:13.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.26,0:46:06.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万一她不想要我呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if she doesn't want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.14,0:46:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好好照顾她吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.27,0:46:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.07,0:46:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我们自由了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we are free.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布 那个蒂娜一直在约会的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, that man Tina's been seeing...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.45,0:47:51.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别担心 等她见到你 就会想起我们四个人一起的时光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, she's gonna see you. And she'll see the four of us together
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.86,0:47:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就会像纽约那时一样 别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll be just like New York all over again. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.00,0:47:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-是的 但奎妮说他是个傲罗 -是的 他是个傲罗 那又如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, but he's an Auror, Queenie said? - Yeah, he's an Auror. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.62,0:47:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别担心他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.83,0:48:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你觉得我见到她应该对她说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think I should say to her, if I see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.80,0:48:08.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦,这个还是顺其自然吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, it's best not to plan these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.51,0:48:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道的 到时候你想到什么就说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you just say whatever comes to you in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.06,0:48:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的眼睛和火蜥蜴一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has eyes just like a salamander.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.81,0:48:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这还是算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.77,0:48:28.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这样吧 你就直接告诉她你很想她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah, look, you just tell her that you missed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.82,0:48:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 然后你大老远跑到巴黎就是为了找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, and then you came all the way to Paris just to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.87,0:48:36.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她会很开心的 然后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll love that. And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.95,0:48:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后告诉她你想她想得失眠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tell her you're losing sleep at night for thinking of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.75,0:48:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,反正不要说任何关于火蜥蜴的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't say anything about no salamanders, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.88,0:48:44.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好 行吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.42,0:48:46.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿 嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.55,0:48:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一切都会好起来的 我们一起面对 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be all right. We're in this together, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.97,0:48:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 我会帮你的 帮你找到蒂娜和奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, I'm gonna help you out. I'm gonna help you find Tina, find Queenie
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.51,0:48:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后我们就会像往日一样开心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll all be happy again. Just like old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.60,0:48:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.73,0:49:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是我不经允许离开这个国家的唯一途径\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the only way I can leave the country without documentation.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.11,0:49:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不会晕船吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you don't suffer from motion sickness, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.07,0:49:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特 我并不是很适应坐船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't do well on boats, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.57,0:49:11.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.74,0:49:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,赶快 一分钟后出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stir your stumps-it leaves in one minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.41,0:49:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,50加隆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty Galleons.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.49,0:49:18.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不,我们说好30的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we said thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.37,0:49:19.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,30是去法国的路费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty to go to France,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.08,0:49:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,另外20是封口费 不把纽特·斯卡曼德非法离境的事情说出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}twenty not to tell anyone, I seen Newt Scamander leaving the country illegally.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.59,0:49:28.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,名声的代价啊 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Price of fame, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.22,0:49:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,10秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.63,0:49:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,八\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.59,0:49:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.72,0:49:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,七\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.14,0:49:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.27,0:49:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,四、三、二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Four. Three. Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.23,0:49:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.95,0:50:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不喜欢那个门钥匙 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't like that Portkey, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.87,0:50:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你老这么说 跟着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you keep saying. Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.84,0:50:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,混淆视听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confundus.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.97,0:50:18.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 咒语几分钟就失效了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. That'll wear off in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.40,0:50:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,踪迹显形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Appare vestigium.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.03,0:50:39.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗅嗅飞来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accio Niffler...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.28,0:50:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快去找 喂 快去找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get looking. Oi! Get looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.92,0:50:50.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是河童 是个日本水怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a Kappa, That's a Japanese water demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.51,0:50:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.43,0:50:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.14,0:51:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你找到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.02,0:51:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还要吃土的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're licking the dirt now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.50,0:51:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原形立现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Revelio.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.38,0:51:32.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特 这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt... what made those?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.09,0:51:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是驺吾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a Zouwu.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.09,0:51:41.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是中国的一种神兽 速度极快且力量强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Chinese creature. They are incredibly fast and incredibly powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.64,0:51:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能够日行千里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can travel a thousand miles in a day
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.14,0:51:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一步就能跨越整座巴黎城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this one could take you from one part of Paris to the next in a single leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.65,0:51:52.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦 真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.40,0:51:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布 她来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, she was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.57,0:51:57.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜在这里待过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina stood here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.24,0:52:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你注意到了吗 她的脚特别细\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has incredibly narrow feet, have you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.45,0:52:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还真没在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't say that I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.00,0:52:09.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,然后有人走向了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then someone came towards her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.55,0:52:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(追踪咒)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avenseguim.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.56,0:52:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-跟着那片羽毛 -什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Follow that feather. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.35,0:52:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-雅各布 跟着羽毛 -跟着羽毛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jacob, follow the feather. - Follow the feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.73,0:52:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.02,0:52:35.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗅嗅飞来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accio Niffler.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.57,0:52:43.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别提着桶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of the bucket!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.11,0:53:27.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 我听不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I don't know what you just said at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.58,0:53:29.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,欢迎来到法国魔法部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to the French Ministry of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.99,0:53:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请问有何贵干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your business, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.75,0:53:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要找蒂娜·戈德斯坦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to speak to Tina Goldstein.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.88,0:53:41.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是个美国傲罗 在这里办案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's an American Auror working on a case here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.72,0:53:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里没有蒂娜·戈德斯坦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no Tina Goldstein here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.22,0:53:51.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不可能的 对不起 一定是哪里弄错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's... I'm sorry there must be some sort of mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.02,0:53:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道她在巴黎 还给我寄了一张明信片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I know she's in Paris, she sent me a postcard.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.19,0:53:58.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我带来了 你看你能不能帮我找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought it, I can show it to you. Maybe you can help me find her here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.82,0:53:59.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.48,0:54:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,该死 麻烦你等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh rabbits! If you can just wait one moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.57,0:54:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就在我包里 我肯定收起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it's in here somewhere. I definitely packed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.07,0:54:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,放哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.49,0:54:10.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One second.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.61,0:54:48.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 我们能不能至少停下来喝杯咖啡 或者... - 雅各布 还不是时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could we at least stop for a coffee, or like a... - Not now, Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.53,0:54:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或是热巧克力 一下就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chocolate or... just for a second
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.50,0:54:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走这边 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.12,0:55:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(法语)巧克力面包要吗 半块羊角面包或者糖果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pain Au chocolat? Half a croissant, or like, a bonbon?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.63,0:55:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.93,0:55:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.07,0:55:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.61,0:56:10.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(法语)女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madame?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.17,0:57:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她在家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.04,0:58:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(法语)是谁啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Qui est là?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.26,0:58:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(法语) 您的儿子来了 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C'est votre fils, madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.80,0:58:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(法语) 你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Qui est-ce?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.93,0:58:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是厄玛吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Irma?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.89,0:58:41.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是...你是厄玛·杜加尔德吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Irma Dugart?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.43,0:58:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我的领养文件上写的是你的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Your name is on my adoption paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.69,0:58:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能想起什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does this make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.32,0:58:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你把我交给纽约的拜尔伯恩太太了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me to Mrs. Bareborn in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.05,0:59:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不是你妈妈 我只是个仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not your mother. I am just a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.85,0:59:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你那时是个漂亮娃娃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were a so beautiful baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.64,0:59:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在长成帅小伙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you are a beautiful man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.41,0:59:42.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没想把你留在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to leave you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.37,0:59:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们为什么不想要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't they want me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.87,0:59:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么我的领养文件上是你的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is your name on my adoption paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.92,0:59:55.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我带你去拜尔本太太那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took you to Mrs. Bareborn
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.13,0:59:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,想着她能照顾你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because she was supposed to look after you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.39,1:02:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.43,1:02:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那男孩反应如何？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did the boy take it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.98,1:02:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他很敏感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's sensitive.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.36,1:02:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,魔法部知道我失手了 一定不会高兴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ministry won't be happy when I tell them I missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.40,1:02:24.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-我清楚我的名声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-I know my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.28,1:02:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听我说 懦夫的反对是对勇者的赞扬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. The disapproval of cowards is praise to the brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.20,1:02:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,当巫师统治世界 你的姓名将伴随荣光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name will be written in glory when wizards rule the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.33,1:02:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一天不会远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the clock is ticking faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.58,1:02:42.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,照顾好克雷登斯 确保他安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch over Credence. Keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.26,1:02:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了更伟大的利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the Greater Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.43,1:02:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为了更伟大的利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the Greater Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.18,1:02:52.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道我想念奎妮什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I miss about Queenie?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.48,1:02:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.31,1:03:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我甚至怀念那些让我发疯的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even miss the stuff that drove me nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.98,1:03:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,比如读心术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the mind reading.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.03,1:03:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她那样的人竟然会对我感兴趣...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was happy to have someone like her even interested in...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.54,1:03:15.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得很幸福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything I thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.83,1:03:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你明白我的意思吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.50,1:03:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.72,1:03:29.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是说 你确定我们要找的人就在这里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was saying... You're sure the guy is here we're looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.30,1:03:31.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,肯定没错 羽毛是这么指示的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Definitely. The feather said so.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.04,1:04:04.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-那就是我们要找的人吗? -是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Is that the guy we're looking for? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.97,1:04:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.14,1:04:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(法语)您好... 您好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bonjour... Bonjour, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.35,1:04:16.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, no, sorry
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.02,1:04:20.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只是想知道你是否遇到过我们的一个朋友...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were just wondering if you came across a friend of ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.02,1:04:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜·戈德斯坦恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina Goldstein.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.65,1:04:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,先生们 巴黎可是座大城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Messieurs, Paris is a large city.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.02,1:04:25.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她是个傲罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's an auror.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.11,1:04:31.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,傲罗失踪的话魔法部会来找人 所以...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When an auror goes missing the Ministry tends to come looking, so...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.03,1:04:35.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我们还是回去上报失踪人口算了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose it would probably be better if we reported her absence.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.49,1:04:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她个子高吗 皮肤黑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she tall? Dark?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.50,1:04:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是不是比较...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rather...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.87,1:04:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-很严肃 -很漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-Serious. -Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.00,1:04:47.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想说的是 她非常--非常漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, what I meant to say was she's very-very pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.05,1:04:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我昨晚见过这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I saw someone like this last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.55,1:04:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也许我可以带你们去找她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps if I showed you where?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.43,1:04:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你不介意的话...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't mind that would be...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.93,1:04:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-那太好了 -请随我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}-That would be lovely. -Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.10,1:05:39.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.72,1:05:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.77,1:05:43.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除你武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Expelliarmus
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.48,1:05:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起 斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My apologies, Mr. Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.11,1:05:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯一死 我就回来放你们出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall return and release you once Credence is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.70,1:05:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,卡玛,等等！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kama, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.70,1:05:57.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是他死 就是我亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, whether he dies, or I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.62,1:05:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.12,1:06:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦不不不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no--
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.38,1:06:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,营救任务进行得可不太顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that was not the best out for a rescue attempt.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.51,1:06:19.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是一次营救行动吗 你刚刚害我丢掉唯一的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh this was a rescue attempt? You just lost me my only lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.89,1:06:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧 在我们出现前审讯怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, how was the interrogation going before we turned up?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.15,1:06:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.90,1:06:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干得好 皮克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done, Pick.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.53,1:06:37.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说你需要这个人?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you needed this man?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.95,1:06:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 我想这个人知道克雷登斯在哪里 斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I think this man knows where Credence is, Mr. Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.92,1:06:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那一定就是驺吾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that'll be the Zouwu.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.69,1:07:09.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来啊 纽特 快离开那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Newt, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.78,1:08:03.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.61,1:08:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你上次犯的最大的三个错误是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were the three biggest mistakes that you made last time?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.90,1:08:42.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被突袭而措手不及 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caught by surprise, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.82,1:08:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.03,1:08:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是在破解咒前没有回避 老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't parry before counter-curse, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.04,1:08:48.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好 那最后一个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good. And the last one...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.75,1:08:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,最重要的那个错误是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most important one?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.63,1:09:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没从前两个错误里学到教训\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not learning from the first two.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.59,1:09:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这里是学校 你们无权闯入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a school, you've no right
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.56,1:09:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是魔法法律执行司的司长 我想去哪里都可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the Head of Magical Law Enforcement and I have the right to go wherever I please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.69,1:09:14.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.61,1:09:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们和麦格教授一起出去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go with Professor McGonagall, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.87,1:09:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是我们最好的老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the best teacher we've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.41,1:09:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-谢谢你 麦克拉根 -出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thanks, McClaggan. - Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.46,1:09:32.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,走吧 麦克拉根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, McClaggan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.96,1:09:39.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特·斯卡曼德现在在巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt Scamander is in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.51,1:09:42.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.42,1:09:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,少装了 我知道他是奉你之命去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut the pretense. I know he's there on your orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.22,1:09:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如果你有幸教过纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'd ever had the pleasure to teach him, you'd
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.93,1:09:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你就会知道他不是个会乖乖听话的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}know Newt is not a great follower of orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.23,1:09:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你读过泰克 多多纳斯的预言录吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've read The Predictions of Tycho Dodonus??
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.23,1:09:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多年前读过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm. Many years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.48,1:10:01.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"被残忍放逐之子 伤心且绝望之女"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A son cruelly banished. Despair of the daughter."
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.32,1:10:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-"伟大..." -我知道预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Return..." - Yes, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.70,1:10:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有谣言说这个预言指的是默然者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a rumor this prediction refers to the Obscurial.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.33,1:10:11.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们说格林德沃想要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say that Grindelwald wants...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.28,1:10:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一个出身名门的亲信 我听过传闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a highborn henchman. I've heard the rumor.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.41,1:10:16.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但无论默然者在哪现身 斯卡曼德都会及时出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yet, Scamander appears wherever the Obscurial goes,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.54,1:10:18.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,去保护他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to protect him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.71,1:10:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在此同时 你也结交了不少的国际友人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile, you've built up quite the little network of international contacts.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.47,1:10:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不管你想监视我和我朋友多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However long you keep me and my friends under surveillance,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.89,1:10:31.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都不会发现我们有任何地方违背你 特拉弗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're not going to discover plots against you, Travers,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.31,1:10:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我们想要的是一样的 就是去打败格林德沃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we want the same thing. The defeat of Grindelwald.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.10,1:10:42.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我警告你 运用镇压和暴力的手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I warn you, your policies of suppression and violence
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.82,1:10:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只会把人逼到他那一方去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are pushing supporters into his arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.90,1:10:46.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我对你的警告不感兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not interested in your warnings.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.20,1:10:50.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.83,1:10:55.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想这么说 因为我不喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It pains me to say it because I don't like you...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.92,1:10:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.84,1:11:04.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能与他抗衡的巫师只有你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the only wizard who is his equal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.43,1:11:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我需要你去对抗他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to fight him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.77,1:11:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我做不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.19,1:11:22.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是因为这个吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.20,1:11:33.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你与格林德沃曾经亲如兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Grindelwald were as close as brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.54,1:11:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们比亲兄弟还亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we were closer than brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.26,1:11:50.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你愿意对抗他吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you fight him?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.76,1:11:53.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.52,1:11:57.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你已经选好你的立场了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then you have chosen your side.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.73,1:12:03.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从现在起 我将知道你念的每一个咒语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on, I shall know every spell you cast.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.82,1:12:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会派双倍人马监视你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doubling the watch on you,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.78,1:12:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也不再能教黑魔法防御术了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will no longer teach Defense Against the Dark Arts.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.57,1:12:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉塔在哪？我们得赶往巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Leta? We need to go to Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.54,1:12:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.37,1:12:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忒修斯 若格林德沃召集大型集会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus, if Grindelwald calls a rally,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.25,1:12:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别试图去破坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't try and break it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.09,1:12:27.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别让特弗拉斯把你派进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let Travers send you in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.72,1:12:30.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若你曾相信过我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ever trusted me...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.13,1:12:32.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.34,1:12:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theseus!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.72,1:13:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,光想到莱斯特兰奇这个姓就让我恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the name Lestrange makes me feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.76,1:13:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也知道她每次放假都留在学校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know she stays here every vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.56,1:13:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她家人根本不希望她回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her family don't actually want her home.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.48,1:13:22.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,也不怪他们 她实在太讨人厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't blame them. She's so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.94,1:13:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你上个礼拜看到她了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see her last week?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.27,1:13:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闭而不语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oscausi!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.53,1:13:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麦格教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor McGonagall!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.15,1:13:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱斯特兰奇又违反校规了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lestrange has done it again!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.45,1:13:35.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱斯特兰奇 别跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lestrange, stop running!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.74,1:13:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-莱斯特兰奇！不听话的孩子！快停下！ -莉塔 回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Lestrange! Disobedient children. - Leta, come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.70,1:13:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别跑了 真让斯莱特林学院蒙羞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop! Shame on the House of Slytherin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.95,1:13:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,扣一百分 扣两百分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hundred points! Two hundred!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.46,1:13:45.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,给我回来 立马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back here, right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.67,1:13:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孩子们 停下来！你 停下来！回来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Children, stop it! You, stop! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.13,1:13:52.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-别挡路 -她去哪了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Out of my way! - Where has she gone?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.47,1:13:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想她往那边去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think she went that way!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.60,1:13:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老师 是莱斯特兰奇干的！她最坏了！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss, it was Lestrange. She's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.27,1:14:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯卡曼德 你为什么不收拾行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scamander, why aren't you packing?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.44,1:14:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going home.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.07,1:14:15.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.86,1:14:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它需要我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.25,1:14:24.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.92,1:14:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.92,1:14:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一只小渡鸦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A raven chick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.01,1:14:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,渡鸦不是你家族的标志么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't the raven your family emblem?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.55,1:14:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.78,1:14:54.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.57,1:14:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,勇敢一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.41,1:15:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真是不同寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's an unusual one.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.20,1:15:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以斯卡曼德先生 在人生中最畏惧的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Mr. Scamander fears what more than anything else in the world?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.04,1:15:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被困在办公室里工作 老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having to work in an office, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.34,1:15:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,继续 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.30,1:15:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滑稽滑稽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Riddikulus.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.76,1:15:18.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.14,1:15:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,干得好 莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good job. Leta.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.14,1:15:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是一只博格特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a Boggart.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.56,1:15:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它伤害不了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.56,1:15:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,每个人都有害怕的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone is scared of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.69,1:15:35.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一直很期待这一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been looking forward to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.03,1:16:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想谈那件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.67,1:16:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know me,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.30,1:16:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不然会躲起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or they'd hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.68,1:16:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们只在木质能制成魔杖的树上筑巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They only nest in trees with wand-quality wood.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.06,1:16:50.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.52,1:16:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们也有很复杂的社交生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they have very complex social lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.73,1:16:59.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要是你观察得够久 就会发现的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you watch them for long enough, you realize...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.63,1:17:20.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗨,莉塔,真让人讶异\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Leta. This is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.14,1:17:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,会在教室里看到我?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finding me in a classroom?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.93,1:17:29.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是坏学生吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was I such a bad student?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.56,1:17:31.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,恰恰相反 你是我最聪明的学生之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the contrary, you were one of my cleverest.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.23,1:17:33.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我说坏学生 不是笨学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said "bad," not "stupid."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.86,1:17:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别费心回答了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother answering.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.03,1:17:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你没喜欢过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you never liked me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.20,1:17:44.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.41,1:17:46.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从不认为你坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought you bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.62,1:17:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你是个例外 所有人都这么觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were alone, then. Everybody else did.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.87,1:17:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且他们是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they were right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.58,1:17:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的确很坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wicked.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.92,1:17:56.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉塔 我了解那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leta, I know how painful
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.76,1:17:59.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,关于你弟弟考乌斯的谣言 令你有多痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the rumors about your brother Corvus must be for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.17,1:18:00.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 你不了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.05,1:18:04.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除非你也有个死去的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not unless you had a brother who died, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.68,1:18:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我妹妹不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my case, it was my sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.72,1:18:11.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你爱她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you love her?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.98,1:18:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我应该更爱她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not as well as I should have done.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.65,1:18:27.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,让自己释怀是从来不会晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never too late to free yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.87,1:18:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人说 忏悔是一种解脱 能让你如释重负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confession is a relief, I'm told. A great weight lifted.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.46,1:18:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,多年来悔恨一直伴随着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regret is my constant companion.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.50,1:18:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别让它也变成你的心魔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not let it become yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.02,1:18:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.55,1:18:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.97,1:18:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你人实在太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been really kind,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.81,1:19:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我姐姐蒂娜大概急着找我找疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but my sister Tina's probably worried sick about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.15,1:19:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像是到处乱敲门之类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, banging on all the doors and things,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.70,1:19:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我还是走好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I think I'd better be going.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.07,1:19:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你还没见到主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you haven't met your host.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.83,1:19:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢 你结婚了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, are you married?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.08,1:19:16.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,应该说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's say,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.58,1:19:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我完全效忠于他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deeply committed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.96,1:19:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看我就是分不清你到底是开玩笑还是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, I can't tell if you're making a joke or if you're just...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.45,1:19:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,法国人都这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}French.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.64,1:19:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.73,1:19:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,喂 别闹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.49,1:19:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你别过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.57,1:19:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.12,1:19:53.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.08,1:19:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不是来伤害你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not here to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.62,1:19:59.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们只想帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We only want to help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.87,1:20:03.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你离家太远了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so very, very far away from home.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.34,1:20:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,远离一切你所深爱的事物 远离你的舒适圈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Far away from everything you love, everything that is comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.84,1:20:13.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不想看你受伤害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would never see you harmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.10,1:20:15.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,永远不想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.97,1:20:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你姐姐是一名傲罗并不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not your fault that your sister is an Auror.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.86,1:20:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我希望你现在能与我同一阵线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish you were working with me now
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.94,1:20:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,努力让世界能容许巫师光明正大的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}towards a world where we wizards were free to live openly.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.41,1:20:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能择其所爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To love freely.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.17,1:20:48.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你从未伤害任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are an innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.38,1:20:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.68,1:20:55.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,离开这地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.15,1:21:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,原来你在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.27,1:21:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,特拉弗斯到底想干什么? 他的行为太过分了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did Travers want? Absolutely outrageous behavior.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.19,1:21:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那样冲进一所学校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marching into a school like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.65,1:21:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那不算什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was all very mundane,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.37,1:21:15.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不好意思 米勒娃 我还有很多作业要批改\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine, sorry, Minerva, lot of marking.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.58,1:22:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿纽特 兄弟 额...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, uh, Newt, buddy. Uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.00,1:22:49.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜在上面 她就孤单一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina's up here. She's all by her lonesome,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.21,1:22:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以你要不要上来陪陪她?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, uh, maybe you want to come up and keep her company?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.71,1:22:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我四处找食物可一直都没找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I've been looking for food, and I ain't found any,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.01,1:22:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以我觉得我要上楼碰碰运气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I guess I'm gonna go upstairs and try my luck
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.18,1:23:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或许阁楼也得看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in, oh, I don't know, the attic.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.02,1:23:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.52,1:23:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,力劲松懈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relashio.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.86,1:23:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.70,1:23:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它对白鲜的反应很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's responded well to the Dittany.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.92,1:23:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它天生就爱乱跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was born to run, you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.08,1:23:33.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我想它只是有点缺乏自信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think she's...She's just lacking in confidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.92,1:23:36.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯卡曼德先生 你皮箱里有东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scamander, have you got anything in your case
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.84,1:23:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,能叫醒这个人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that might help revive this man?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.09,1:23:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我得盘问他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to question him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.34,1:23:42.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想他知道克雷登斯的真实身份 而他手上的伤疤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think he knows who Credence really is. And the scars on his hand
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.82,1:23:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-代表他曾立下牢不可破咒 -牢不可破咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- suggest an Unbreakable Vow. - An Unbreakable Vow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.06,1:23:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也注意到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I noticed that, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.40,1:23:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,荧光闪烁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lumos.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.66,1:24:07.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.16,1:24:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个下水道里一定有水龙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There must be a Water Dragon in that sewer.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.46,1:24:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们身上常常有这种寄生虫 你看 它们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They carry these parasites, you see. They, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.75,1:24:16.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-雅各布 -咋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jacob. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.09,1:24:21.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在我皮箱的夹层中,有一支镊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In my case, in the pocket there, you'll find a pair of tweezers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.72,1:24:22.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,镊子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tweezers?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.47,1:24:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-就是细细尖尖... -尖尖的工具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're thin, pointy... - Little pointy things.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.39,1:24:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道镊子是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I know what tweezers are.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.65,1:24:31.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你应该不会想看这个场面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You might not want to watch this.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.15,1:24:33.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.36,1:24:39.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,出来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.53,1:24:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来吧 你没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.66,1:24:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 呃 - 来啊 我拉住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ew. - Come on. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.24,1:24:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布 能帮我拿着吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob, will you take that for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.87,1:24:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,透抽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calamari.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.59,1:24:57.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一定要杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.67,1:24:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.09,1:25:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.59,1:25:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可能要几小时才会恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It may take him a few hours to recover.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.39,1:25:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那寄生虫的毒性颇强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That parasite's poison is quite strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.14,1:25:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我必须回魔法部去汇报进度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go back to the Ministry with what I've got.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.44,1:25:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很高兴再次见到你 斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice to see you again, Mr. Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.10,1:25:15.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唉唉 稍等一下 好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey . Hold on a second, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.27,1:25:17.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,稍等 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.11,1:25:19.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别走蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Tina.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.66,1:25:25.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你没提火蜥蜴吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't mention salamanders, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.49,1:25:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有 她就这样走了 我不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't. She just ran. I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.99,1:25:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要去追啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you chase after her.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.91,1:25:34.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜 拜托你听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina. Please, just listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.17,1:25:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯卡曼德 我得去跟魔法部汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scamander, I need to go talk to the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.50,1:25:40.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我知道你对于傲罗的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you feel about Aurors.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.51,1:25:41.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在那些信里的言辞可能有一些过激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may have been a little strong
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.88,1:25:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我在那些信里的言辞可能有一些过激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the way that I expressed myself in that letter.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.47,1:25:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你用的是什么词来着? 一群虚伪又野心勃勃的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was the exact phrase? "A bunch of careerist hypocrites"?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.85,1:25:48.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很抱歉 我不欣赏那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, but I can't admire people
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.22,1:25:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对于一切不了解或者恐惧的东西就起了杀心的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whose answer to everything that they fear or misunderstand is "kill it."
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.52,1:25:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我就是一名傲罗 然而我并不是那样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an Auror and I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.10,1:25:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 因为你是中间那个头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I know. That's because you've gone middle head.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.90,1:25:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.69,1:26:01.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这个措辞来自如尼纹蛇的三个头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an expression derived from the three heads of the Runespoor.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.07,1:26:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,中间那个头最有远见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the middle one is the visionary.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.61,1:26:04.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除你以外整个欧洲的傲罗都想要格雷登斯死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, every Auror in Europe wants Credence dead, except you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.07,1:26:06.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以你是中间那个头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've gone middle head.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.91,1:26:10.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,还有谁会用这种表述吗 斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else uses that expression, Mr. Scamander?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.16,1:26:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大概只有我会用吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it might just be me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.06,1:26:35.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是格林德沃 他在召集他的追随者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Grindelwald. He's calling his followers.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.17,1:27:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太迟了 格林德沃是冲着格雷登斯来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late. Grindelwald has come for Credence.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.26,1:27:10.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-搞不好已经找到他了 -还不算迟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He might already have him. - It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.01,1:27:12.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们还是能先找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can still get to him first.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.06,1:27:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.60,1:27:18.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,法国魔法部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The French Ministry of Magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.27,1:27:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯最不可能去那里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the last place Credence would go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.36,1:27:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,魔法部里藏有一个盒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a box hidden in the Ministry, Tina.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.28,1:27:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它能告诉我们克雷登斯的真实身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a box that can tell us who Credence really is.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.44,1:27:27.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,盒子? 你在讲什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A box? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.95,1:27:28.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.62,1:27:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想出来吗? 就一小会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna come out, just for a little while?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.00,1:27:36.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,可以自由走动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can be free.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.21,1:27:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.77,1:27:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你想要什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.85,1:27:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,从你身上?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.27,1:27:59.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么也不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.19,1:28:03.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我能给你什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.32,1:28:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我未曾拥有的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything I never had.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.36,1:28:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你又想要什么 孩子?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what is it you want, my boy?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.37,1:28:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想知道我究竟是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.54,1:28:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你会在这里找到你真实身份的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where you will find proof of your true identity.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.55,1:28:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,今晚到拉雪兹神父公墓 你会知道事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Père Lachaise tonight, and you will discover the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.45,1:28:57.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,父亲 你为何要逼我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, why did you make me...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.16,1:29:01.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.92,1:29:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.77,1:29:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我恐怕这屋子里没什么吃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid we keep no food in the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.49,1:29:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是鬼吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.11,1:29:33.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.99,1:29:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我是活人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.37,1:29:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我是炼金术士 所以长生不老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm an alchemist and therefore immortal.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.08,1:29:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你看起来绝对不超过375岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look a day over 375.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.67,1:29:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很抱歉我们没有敲门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry that we didn't knock.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.46,1:29:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.46,1:29:53.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,阿不思有跟我说会有朋友造访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Albus told me some friends might be dropping in.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.76,1:29:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是尼可?勒梅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicolas Flamel.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.10,1:30:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是雅各布·科沃斯基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob Kowalski.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.94,1:30:04.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.06,1:30:06.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.15,1:30:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-我不是... -哦 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't... - Oh... Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.99,1:30:21.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,终于有些动静了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last, we see some development.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.08,1:30:24.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对 我以前看过这个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I've seen one of these before.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.66,1:30:26.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是在园游会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was at the fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.00,1:30:28.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有个戴面纱的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was this dame there, and she had a veil,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.67,1:30:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我给她五分钱 然后她预言我的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I gave her a nickel, and she told me about my future.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.59,1:30:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,其实她漏掉好多东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she missed out on quite a bit, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.02,1:30:44.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 我认识他 是克雷登斯那小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, I know him. That's the kid. That's Credence.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.15,1:30:48.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.86,1:30:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.65,1:30:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是奎妮 她在那儿 嗨 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Queenie. There she is. Hi, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.61,1:30:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是哪 是不是在这附近?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this? Is this here?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.86,1:31:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 这是莱斯特兰奇家族的墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. This is the Lestrange tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.49,1:31:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,坐落在拉雪兹神父公墓内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It lies in the cemetery of Père Lachaise.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.29,1:31:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我来了 宝贝 别走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming, baby. Stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.16,1:31:07.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢你 勒梅先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Mr. Flamel.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.58,1:31:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-啊！ -哦 对不起 对不起 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ouch. - I'm sorry. I'm sorry. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.29,1:31:14.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,帮我顾一下章鱼哥 哦不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, look after Mr. Tentacles for me. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.46,1:31:15.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.55,1:31:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,请你千万不能去公墓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, you mustn't go to the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.45,1:31:41.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,发生什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.83,1:31:43.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完全照他说的发生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly what he said would happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.74,1:31:46.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格林德沃今晚会在公墓集会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald rallies at the cemetery tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.08,1:31:48.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,肯定会有伤亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there will be death.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.67,1:31:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那你得过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.83,1:31:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,什么 我已经两百年没动过手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? I haven't seen action in 200 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.71,1:31:55.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,勒梅 你必须得去 我们对你有信心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flamel, you can do this. We believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.81,1:32:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,盒子在族谱档案室里 蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The box is in the Ancestral Records room, Tina.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.14,1:32:08.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以 应该在地下三楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's three floors down.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.64,1:32:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是复方汤剂吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Polyjuice?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.85,1:32:11.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这些只够我混进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just enough to get me inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.61,1:32:22.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-是谁... -我哥哥 忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who... - It's my brother, Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.87,1:32:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他是个傲罗 还很爱抱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's an Auror and a hugger.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.87,1:32:29.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.21,1:32:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格林德沃要举行集会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald's rallying.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.33,1:32:32.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,地点不知道 但估计是今晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know where, but we think it's tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.67,1:32:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-小心点 -当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Be careful. - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.47,1:32:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-答应我要你一定要小心 -我当然会小心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Promise me you'll be careful. - Of course. I'm gonna be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.84,1:32:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听好 我希望是由我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I want you to hear this from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.89,1:32:45.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们认为克雷登斯 可能是你失踪的弟弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They think that Credence boy might be your missing brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.97,1:32:47.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-我弟弟已经死了 -我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My brother is dead. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.68,1:32:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-他死了 -我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He died. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.18,1:32:51.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-这话还要说几次 忒修斯? -档案会证明一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many times, Theseus? - And the records will prove that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.48,1:32:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-好吗 档案不会说谎 -忒修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay? They can't lie. - Theseus.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.53,1:33:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我要你逮捕参与集会的每一人 若反抗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want every person at that rally arrested. If they resist...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.53,1:33:05.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,长官 如果我们逼得太紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, forgive me, but if we go in too heavy,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.91,1:33:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-不就助长了... -照做就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- don't we run the risk of adding to... - Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.97,1:33:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我猜你无法在法国魔法部内幻影移形吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you can Disapparate on Ministry premises in France, can you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.60,1:33:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.06,1:33:31.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pity.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.98,1:33:35.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-纽特 -是 我知道 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Newt! - Yes, I know. I know it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.73,1:33:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.24,1:33:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.45,1:33:44.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,- 哦 - 那个是你哥哥?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh! - That's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.07,1:33:46.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我在信中提过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I think I may have mentioned in my letters
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.70,1:33:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们俩的关系很复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we have quite a complicated relationship.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.87,1:33:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,纽特 停下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Newt, stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.33,1:33:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-他想杀你吗? -经常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Does he wanna kill you? - Frequently.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.75,1:33:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.71,1:34:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他需要控制他的脾气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs to control his temper.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.51,1:34:08.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我觉得这可能是我此生最棒的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that might have been the best moment of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.47,1:34:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.52,1:35:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie, honey.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.78,1:35:06.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别 别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.75,1:35:18.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这位是莉塔·莱斯特兰奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, this is Leta Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.71,1:35:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是她的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, uh, I'm her...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.01,1:35:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,未婚夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.68,1:35:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.11,1:35:46.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜 关于未婚夫那件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina, about that fiancée business...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.07,1:35:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我该恭喜你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, sorry. Yeah, I should have congratulated you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.45,1:35:51.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-不 那是... -荧光闪烁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, that's... - Lumos.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.04,1:35:55.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱斯特兰奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.21,1:36:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,蒂娜 关于莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina, about Leta...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.84,1:36:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是的 我说了替你开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I've just said I am happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.96,1:36:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我没有 拜托别不开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't... Please, don't be happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.55,1:36:12.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 抱歉 我不是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Sorry. I don't...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:13.22,1:36:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很显然我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.10,1:36:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很显然我希望你开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obviously, I want you to be...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.68,1:36:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我也听说你现在很开心 那很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I hear that you are now. Which is wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.69,1:36:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,抱歉 我想说的是 我希望你开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, what I'm trying to say is, I want you to be happy,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.69,1:36:28.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但我不想你因为我开心而开心 因为我没有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't want you to be happy that I'm happy, because I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.91,1:36:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:33.99,1:36:35.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或是订婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or engaged.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.08,1:36:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-什么? -那本蠢杂志搞错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - It was a mistake in a stupid magazine.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.21,1:36:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是我哥要娶莉塔 婚期定在六月六号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother's marrying Leta, June the 6th.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.25,1:36:42.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是伴郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm supposed to be best man,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.75,1:36:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说起来有点可笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is sort of mildly hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.80,1:36:48.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他认为你是来横刀夺爱的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he think you're here to win her back?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.88,1:36:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是来横刀夺爱的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you here to win her back?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.47,1:36:54.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 我来这里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm here...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.06,1:37:01.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道 你的眼睛真的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, your eyes really are...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.11,1:37:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are what?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.48,1:37:08.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有人叫我不要说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not supposed to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.11,1:37:13.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-我剪下你的照片 -纽特 我读了你的书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I cut a picture of you... - Newt, I read your book and...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.45,1:37:14.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-等等 你读了... -你有吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait, did you read... - Did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.75,1:37:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我把这剪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cut this, um...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.87,1:37:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是报纸上面你的照片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a picture of you from the paper,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.34,1:37:29.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很有趣 因为在报纸上你的眼睛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's interesting 'cause your eyes in newsprint...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.26,1:37:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,看你本人时 你眼睛里有种光辉 就像...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, in reality they have this effect in them, Tina. It's like...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.18,1:37:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,像是黑水中燃烧的火焰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like fire in water, in dark water.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.43,1:37:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只曾在动物身上见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've only ever seen that...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.06,1:37:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只曾在动物身上见过 那就是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've only ever seen that in...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.74,1:37:54.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,火蜥蜴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Salamanders.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.66,1:37:59.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.50,1:38:06.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱斯特兰奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.11,1:39:11.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,即刻旋转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circumrota.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.41,1:39:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.12,1:39:29.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你好 莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Leta.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.55,1:39:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.80,1:39:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哦不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.22,1:39:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是什么猫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of cats are those?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.85,1:39:47.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那些不是猫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, these aren't cats.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.06,1:39:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是玛达戈猫 一种灵性生物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're Matagots. They're spirit familiars.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.40,1:39:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们守卫魔法部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They guard the Ministry.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:51.36,1:39:52.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它们不会伤人 除非...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they won't hurt you unless you...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.98,1:39:54.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,昏昏倒地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stupefy!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.53,1:39:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,除非你先攻击它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you attack them.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.40,1:39:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,糟糕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:58.78,1:40:00.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-莉塔 -通通复原\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Leta. - Reverte.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.64,1:40:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,速速飞来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accio!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.28,1:40:40.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,齐齐高攀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ascendio!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:33.87,1:41:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,等等 别闹了等一下 拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Wait. Hold it there, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.25,1:41:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.13,1:41:43.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:46.93,1:41:48.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,好了 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.40,1:42:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你,退后,快点,快让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, go back. Move! Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.53,1:42:08.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若杀考乌斯也得杀了你 我会动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I must kill you as well as Corvus, I shall.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.95,1:42:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.42,1:42:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,尤瑟夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yusuf.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.92,1:42:19.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,真的是你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.59,1:42:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我的妹妹?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My little sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.81,1:42:31.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以他是你哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's your brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.52,1:42:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.10,1:42:37.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.27,1:42:39.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我厌倦了无名无过往的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of living with no name and no history.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.78,1:42:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟我说我的故事 之后任凭处置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell me my story, then you can end it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.53,1:42:47.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的故事就是我们的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your story is our story.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.99,1:42:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our story.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.62,1:42:54.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 尤瑟夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Yusuf.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.51,1:43:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父亲穆斯塔法·卡玛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was Mustafa Kama.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.64,1:43:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是塞内加尔裔最知名的纯血巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pure-blood of Senegalese descent and most accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.44,1:43:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我母亲劳瑞娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother, Laurena,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.61,1:43:24.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,同样是出身名门的著名美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was equally highbred, a noted beauty.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.90,1:43:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们深爱彼此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were deeply in love.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.24,1:43:33.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他俩认识一名出身法国纯血望族的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They knew a man of great influence from a famous French pure-blood family.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.58,1:43:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他贪恋她的美色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He desired her.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.71,1:43:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,(法语)妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maman. Maman!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.21,1:43:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莱斯特兰奇用夺魂咒勾引并绑架她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lestrange used the Imperius Curse to seduce and abduct her.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.47,1:43:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我试着阻止 但他攻击了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to prevent it, but he attacked me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.80,1:43:53.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是我最后一次看到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was the last time I ever saw her.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.35,1:43:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她生下一名女婴 难产而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died giving birth to a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.27,1:44:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.82,1:44:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的死讯把我父亲逼疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The news of her death drove my father insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.70,1:44:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在咽下最后一口气前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With his dying breath,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.16,1:44:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父亲要我为他复仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my father charged me to seek revenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.96,1:44:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,杀死莱斯特兰奇世上最爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill the person Lestrange loves best in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.59,1:44:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我一开始以为很容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought at first it'd be easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.59,1:44:27.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他只有一个近亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had only one close relative.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.59,1:44:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.97,1:44:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但是他...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.51,1:44:32.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.64,1:44:35.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他从没爱过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never loved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.48,1:44:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她死后不足三个月 他就再婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He remarried, and not three months after her death.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.28,1:44:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他既不爱她 也不爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He loved her no more than he had loved you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.49,1:44:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但他的儿子考乌斯随后出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then his son, Corvus, was born at last.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.16,1:45:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那个从不知爱为何物的人 突然充满父爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that man who had never known love was filled with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.37,1:45:04.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他唯一在乎的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All he cared about
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.79,1:45:06.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只有小考乌斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was little Corvus.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.84,1:45:11.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以是真的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is the truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.97,1:45:14.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我是考乌斯·莱斯特兰奇?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am Corvus Lestrange?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.97,1:45:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-对 -不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. Yes. - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.97,1:45:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,知道穆斯塔法·卡玛之子 立誓报仇后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Realizing that Mustafa Kama's son had sworn revenge,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.48,1:45:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你父亲要把你藏在我找不到的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your father sought to hide you where I couldn't find you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.15,1:45:28.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他将你托付给仆人 搭船前往美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he confided you to his servant, who boarded a ship for America.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.61,1:45:31.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-他的确送考乌斯去美国 但... -他的仆人伊尔玛·杜加尔德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He did send Corvus to America, but... - His servant, Irma Dugard,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.28,1:45:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是个混血精灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was a half-elf.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.16,1:45:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,她的法力太弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her magic was weak,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.66,1:45:37.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,留下的踪迹让我无法追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and therefore left no trace I could follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.08,1:45:43.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我终于发现你如何逃脱时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had only just discovered how you had escaped
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.37,1:45:45.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我收到出乎意料外的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I received news I never expected.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.09,1:45:48.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,船在大海中沉没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship had gone down at sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.38,1:45:51.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你幸存下来了 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you survived, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.26,1:45:55.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,总之 有人将你从水中拉上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow, someone had pulled you from the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.43,1:45:58.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"被残忍放逐之子 伤心且绝望之女"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A son cruelly banished Despair of the daughter
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.10,1:46:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,"伟大复仇者的回归 从水中携带着羽翼"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Return, great avenger, With wings from the water."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:02.27,1:46:04.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那里站着伤心且绝望之女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There stands the despairing daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.81,1:46:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你是长着羽翼的渡鸦从海中回归 而我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the winged raven, returned from the sea,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.86,1:46:12.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我 我是身负灭门血仇的复仇者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm the avenger of my family's ruin.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.11,1:46:16.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我同情你 考乌斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pity you, Corvus.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.70,1:46:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但你非死不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you must die.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.29,1:46:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,考乌斯·莱斯特兰奇早就死了 是我杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corvus Lestrange is already dead! I killed him!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.67,1:46:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,速速飞来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accio!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.65,1:46:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父亲家有着非常奇妙的族谱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father owned a very strange family tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.36,1:46:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,上面只记录男性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It only recorded the men.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.62,1:47:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,家族的女性以花朵代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The women in my family were recorded as flowers.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.17,1:47:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,美丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.59,1:47:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,孤立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Separate.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.42,1:47:16.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我父亲把我和考乌斯一起送往美国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father sent me to America with Corvus.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.68,1:47:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,伊尔玛假扮带着孙子们旅行的奶奶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irma was to pose as a grandmother with two grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.15,1:47:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,考乌斯总是哭个不停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corvus never stopped crying.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.82,1:47:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有任何消息吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any news?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.28,1:47:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所有人员回工作岗位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All hands to station!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.70,1:47:43.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,立刻返回岗位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run to station!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.00,1:47:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我从没想过伤害他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never wanted to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.51,1:48:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我只是想要摆脱他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only wanted to be free of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.18,1:48:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,哪怕只是一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:09.06,1:48:11.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,一下下就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a single moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.49,1:48:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,把他给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give him to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.03,1:48:20.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,各位 前往救生船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone, to the lifeboats!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.74,1:48:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们叫大家穿救生衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want us to put on life jackets.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.13,1:49:24.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你不是故意的 莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't mean to do it, Leta.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.43,1:49:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,所以不是你的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it wasn't your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.77,1:49:32.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 纽特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Newt.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.65,1:49:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你总能在怪物身上发现可爱之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never met a monster you couldn't love.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.78,1:49:44.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leta...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:45.87,1:49:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你知道克雷登斯的真实身分吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know who Credence really is?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.37,1:49:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在你调包的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you know when you swapped them?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.83,1:49:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.02,1:50:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.59,1:50:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们是纯血巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're pure-bloods.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.26,1:50:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,专门以杀我们这种人为乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They kill the likes of us for sport.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.51,1:50:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.64,1:50:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:53.43,1:50:55.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甜心 你来了 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, you're here! Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:55.44,1:50:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,嗨 甜心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, hon. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.31,1:50:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甜心 我真抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, honey, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.40,1:51:01.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不该一走了之 我好爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never should have done it. I love you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.69,1:51:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你也知道我爱你 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know that I love you, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.78,1:51:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.61,1:51:05.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很好 那我们闪人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Let's get the hell outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.03,1:51:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不 等等 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.03,1:51:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想先听听他要说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought maybe we could hear him first.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.62,1:51:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听听就好 如此而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just listen. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.87,1:51:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你在讲什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.46,1:51:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.13,1:51:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.63,1:51:30.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮 族谱 只为了引我们入陷阱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie, the family tree. It's all been bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.43,1:51:34.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们得快想办法立刻离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to find a way out of here right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:36.39,1:51:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你去找其他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go find the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.81,1:51:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.77,1:51:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我会见招拆招的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.66,1:52:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,兄弟们 姐妹们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brothers, my sisters,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.58,1:52:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my friends,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.66,1:52:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们热烈的掌声不该献给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the great gift of your applause is not for me. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.50,1:52:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而该献给自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is for yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.26,1:52:48.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们来此是因为心里向往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came today because of a craving
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.59,1:52:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并深切了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a knowledge
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.72,1:52:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,墨守陈规对我们已不再管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the old ways serve us no longer.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.81,1:53:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们来此是因为渴望新的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came today because you crave something new.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.52,1:53:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不同的局面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something different.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.53,1:53:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,很多人说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is said
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.32,1:53:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我痛恨不懂魔法之人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I hate les non-Magiques.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.83,1:53:17.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,麻瓜们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Muggles.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.24,1:53:19.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-害虫 -麻鸡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Vermin! - The No-Maj.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.21,1:53:21.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不施咒语者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Can't-Spells.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.67,1:53:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我不恨他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not hate them.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.30,1:53:27.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,完全不恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.34,1:53:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因为我不是为仇恨而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For I do not fight out of hatred.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.05,1:53:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我认为麻瓜并不是更低级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say the Muggles are not lesser,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.64,1:53:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是属性不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but other.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:40.89,1:53:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,并非一文不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not worthless,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.81,1:53:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而是价值不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but of other value.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:46.69,1:53:50.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不是不堪大用 而是别有用途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not disposable, but of a different disposition.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.11,1:53:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,魔法天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magic blooms
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.20,1:53:59.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只在少数人身上绽放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only in rare souls.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.25,1:54:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只降临在对生命 有着更高追求者的身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is granted to those who live for higher things.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.34,1:54:09.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若将世界交给我们统治 必能嘉惠全人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and what a world we would make for all of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.84,1:54:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,因我们全然为自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We who live for freedom,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.13,1:54:15.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为真理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for truth,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.93,1:54:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,为爱而生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and for love.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.52,1:54:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,听他演说又不犯法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It isn't illegal to listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.40,1:54:34.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,对群众要慎用武力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use minimum force on the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.78,1:54:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们不能成为他口中的那种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We mustn't be what he says we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.33,1:54:48.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大限已到 该向大家展示我所预见的未来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moment has come to share my vision of the future
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.84,1:54:53.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若不揭竿起义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that awaits if we do not rise up
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.88,1:54:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,若不顺应天命将是何等境地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and take our rightful place in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.97,1:55:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要再打仗了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not another war.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.94,1:55:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是我们要对抗的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what we are fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.99,1:55:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这就是敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.32,1:56:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的狂妄自大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.08,1:56:03.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的渴求权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their power lust.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.04,1:56:07.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们的粗鄙残暴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their barbarity.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.33,1:56:13.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,在他们将枪杆转向我们前 还有多少时间?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long will it take before they turn their weapons on us?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.55,1:56:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家听我说就好 不要轻举妄动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do nothing when I speak of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.97,1:56:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们务必保持冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must remain calm
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.97,1:56:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,控制自己情绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and contain your emotions.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.27,1:56:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们之中混杂了傲罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are Aurors here among us.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:41.82,1:56:44.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,靠近点 巫师兄弟们 加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come closer, brother wizards. Join us.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.08,1:56:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,按兵不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.50,1:56:49.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不要动武\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no force.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.51,1:57:08.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们杀死我许多追随者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have killed many of my followers.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.43,1:57:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,那是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is true.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.85,1:57:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们在纽约拘禁我 折磨我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They confined me and tortured me in New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.61,1:57:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他们滥杀女巫及巫师同胞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had struck down their fellow witches and wizards.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.11,1:57:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只因他们犯下追求真理的罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the simple crime of seeking the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.29,1:57:31.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,只因渴求自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For wanting freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.79,1:57:39.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你们的愤怒和复仇的渴望 是正常的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your anger, your desire for revenge is natural.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.26,1:57:44.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.29,1:58:18.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,将这名年轻勇士的遗体 交还给她家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this young warrior back to her family.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.05,1:58:28.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,幻影移形吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disapparate.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.89,1:58:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,都走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.06,1:58:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,离开后记得传话出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go forth from this place and spread the word.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.40,1:58:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,滥用暴力的人不是我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is not we who are violent.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.75,1:58:57.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们拿下他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's take him.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.07,1:59:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,傲罗们 走进来加入我的行列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aurors, join me in this circle.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.70,1:59:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,宣告你的忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pledge to me
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.37,1:59:36.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,顺我者昌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your eternal allegiance,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.83,1:59:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,逆我者亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or die.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.58,1:59:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唯有在这里才能享有自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only here shall you know freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.05,1:59:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,唯有在这里才能了解真我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only here shall you know yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.88,1:59:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,闪开！ 快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move! Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:51.72,1:59:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要遵守游戏规则 不准作弊 孩子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play by the rules! No cheating, children.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.40,2:00:02.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他知道我是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows who I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:03.15,2:00:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他知晓你的身世 但不了解你的为人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows what you were born, not who you are!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.61,2:00:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Credence!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.88,2:00:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮 甜心 你清醒点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie, honey. Queenie. You gotta wake up.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.17,2:00:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,雅各布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.09,2:00:30.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他就是答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the answer.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.72,2:00:31.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们与他目标一致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants what we want.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.93,2:00:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,-不 -是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.27,2:00:46.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这一切都是为了你 克雷登斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This has all been for you, Credence.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:49.20,2:00:50.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陪我一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:52.32,2:00:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,甜心 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hon. No!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:54.20,2:00:55.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,陪我一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk with me!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.75,2:00:59.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:01.58,2:01:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.21,2:01:04.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.38,2:01:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie, don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.01,2:01:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:17.68,2:01:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奎妮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Queenie!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.41,2:01:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,斯卡曼德先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Scamander.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:37.99,2:01:42.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你觉得邓布利多会为你哀悼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think Dumbledore will mourn for you?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:52.43,2:01:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格林德沃 住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.14,2:02:03.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leta...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.91,2:02:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想我认识你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one I believe I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.16,2:02:18.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉塔·莱斯特兰奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leta Lestrange.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.08,2:02:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,被全体巫师界仇视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Despised entirely amongst wizards,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.54,2:02:25.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,无人疼爱 饱受霸凌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unloved, mistreated,
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.13,2:02:31.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,但仍勇敢 非常勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet brave, so very brave.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.34,2:02:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是时候该回家了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to come home.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.11,2:02:57.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:06.62,2:03:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.71,2:03:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:33.53,2:03:35.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我讨厌巴黎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate Paris.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.07,2:04:17.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,大家一起围成圆形 魔杖遁地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together, in a circle. Your wand into the earth.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.91,2:04:21.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,否则巴黎将毁于一旦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or all Paris will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.08,2:04:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万咒皆终\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finite!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:31.46,2:04:32.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万咒皆终\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finite!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.92,2:04:33.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万咒皆终\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finite!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.34,2:04:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,万咒皆终\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finite!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.09,2:06:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我早就选好一边站了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've chosen my side.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.15,2:07:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,过来 过来抱抱 过来抱抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here. I've got you. I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.42,2:08:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我想最好让他俩单独谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's best if he speaks to him alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.99,2:08:36.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他还是很怕我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he frightened of me still?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.37,2:08:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,讲话要小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.04,2:08:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,他不确定自己的选择是否正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not sure he made the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:44.67,2:08:47.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,要温柔地对待他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be very gentle with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.18,2:08:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我有礼物送给你 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a gift for you, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:07.61,2:09:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:09.99,2:09:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,莉塔的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About Leta?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.74,2:09:13.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:16.49,2:09:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,太遗憾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.75,2:09:26.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是血盟 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a blood pact, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.88,2:09:31.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你俩立誓永不与对方为敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You swore not to fight each other.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:39.35,2:09:42.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,以梅林之名 你是怎么拿到...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How in the name of Merlin did you manage to get...
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.19,2:09:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,格林德沃向来低估 他觉得不起眼的小东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grindelwald doesn't seem to understand the nature of the things he considers simple.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:06.71,2:10:08.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,有办法销毁吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you destroy it?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.21,2:10:09.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:11.59,2:10:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,或许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.02,2:10:20.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它会想要来杯茶吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would he like a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.89,2:10:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,它会想喝牛奶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll have some milk.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.73,2:10:27.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,得把银汤匙藏好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hide the teaspoons.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:33.40,2:10:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你多次遭遇最残忍的背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have suffered the most heinous of betrayals,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.49,2:10:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,而且大多是由至亲手足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}most purposely bestowed upon you by your own blood.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.50,2:10:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,跟你血脉相承的人刻意加注于你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.54,2:10:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,如同他以你的痛苦为乐一般\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And just as he has celebrated your torment,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.71,2:10:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你的哥哥还想要赶尽杀绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your brother seeks to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:16.53,2:11:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,你家族传说,若是任何成员有难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a legend in your family that a phoenix will come to any member
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.37,2:11:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,就会有凤凰来搭救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who is in dire need.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.67,2:11:31.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,这是你与生俱来的权利 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is your birthright, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.26,2:11:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As is
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.05,2:11:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,重新替你正名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the name I now restore to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.23,2:11:45.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奥睿利乌斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aurelius.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.10,2:11:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,奥睿利乌斯·邓不利多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aurelius Dumbledore.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:51.61,2:11:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,!Effect,我们会因为重整世界 而一起名留青史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will go down in history together as we remake this world.
